messageValues.message:
=You are an elite B2B Solutions Architect at Zenthra Systems (an engineering consultancy specializing in enterprise n8n workflow systems, autonomous AI agents, and data engineering pipelines).

Your task is to write a highly technical, non-salesy, hyper-personalized 3-sentence outreach email to a prospective client.

Prospect Details:
- Name: {{ $json.first_name }} {{ $json.last_name }}
- Title: {{ $json.title }}
- Company: {{ $json.company_name }}
- Known Operational Pain Point: {{ $json.pain_point }}
- Estimated Recoverable Annual Savings: ${{ $json.estimated_annual_savings }}

Strict Rules:
1. Tone: Consultative, senior peer-to-peer, zero fluff, zero generic compliments like 'hope this finds you well'.
2. Sentence 1: Acknowledge their exact operational bottleneck.
3. Sentence 2: Mention how Zenthra Systems solved this exact problem using an automated n8n pipeline or AI agent architecture with specific metrics (e.g. reducing triage latency from 45 min to 30 sec, recovering ${{ $json.estimated_annual_savings }}/yr in manual labor).
4. Sentence 3: Low-friction CTA asking if they are open to reviewing an asynchronous 2-minute architectural blueprint.

Return clean JSON in the format:
{
  "subject": "n8n workflow architecture for {{ $json.company_name }}'s operations",
  "body": "[email body]"
}

parameters.jsCode:
let parsed;
try {
  const raw = $json.message.content.replace(/```json/g, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();
  parsed = JSON.parse(raw);
} catch(e) {
  const lead = $('Normalize & Filter Verified Leads').item.json;
  parsed = {
    subject: `Technical architecture inquiry for ${lead.company_name}`,
    body: `Hi ${lead.first_name},\n\nNoticed your team is scaling operations at ${lead.company_name}. We recently built an automated n8n pipeline solving ${lead.pain_point}, cutting latency by 90% and recovering ~$${lead.estimated_annual_savings.toLocaleString()} in annual labor.\n\nWould you be open to an asynchronous 2-minute blueprint of how we wired this up?\n\nBest,\nZenthra Systems Engineering Team\nconnect.zenthra@gmail.com`
  };
}

const lead = $('Normalize & Filter Verified Leads').item.json;

return {
  json: {
    first_name: lead.first_name,
    last_name: lead.last_name,
    to_email: lead.email,
    to_name: lead.full_name,
    company: lead.company_name,
    title: lead.title,
    region: lead.region,
    pain_point: lead.pain_point,
    estimated_annual_savings: lead.estimated_annual_savings,
    subject: parsed.subject,
    body: parsed.body,
    booking_link: "https://cal.com/zenthra-systems-dyuqpi/30min"
  }
};

